<h2 class="titlearea" id="Aion_2_Guide">
Aion 2 Guide</h2>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-sm-6"><h3 class="bonfire" id="What_is_Aion_2?">
What is Aion 2?</h3><b>Aion 2</b> is a Fantasy online MMO action RPG developed by NCsoft. The game is an extension, continuation, and a revamp of the setting and core game mechanics initially introduced in the original title Aion in 2008. Aion 2 is utilizing Unreal Engine 5 allowing for the development team to craft a world and environments with rich detail and dynamic lighting. Players will engage in fluid, real-time combat with an action basis. Dodging, strategic strikes, and chained combos are important to winning the day. While the original title came out over a decade ago, Aion 2 aims to revamp the action-adventure experience of the franchise while connecting players in both PvE and PvP play.
<p>As with most MMORPGs, Aion 2 allows for deep player customization beginning with character creation and class selection. The game features eight classes to choose from. Those classes are as follows:
</p>
<ul><li><b><a href="/Gladiator" title="Gladiator">Gladiator</a>:</b> (DPS) Strong AoE attacks and melee combat-focused</li>
<li><b><a href="/Templar" title="Templar">Templar</a>:</b> (Tank) Armed with a shield and capable of strong defensive skills and strategies.</li>
<li><b><a href="/Cleric" title="Cleric">Cleric</a>:</b> (Support) Primarily a healer with combat as a secondary focus.</li>
<li><b><a href="/Chanter" title="Chanter">Chanter</a>:</b> (Support) Offers multifaceted buff supports and potential healing of allies.</li>
<li><b><a href="/Ranger" title="Ranger">Ranger</a>:</b> (Ranged DPS) Utilizes long-range weaponry and traps.</li>
<li><b><a href="/Assassin" title="Assassin">Assassin</a>:</b> (Stealth) Agile and stealthy capable of burst damage from behind.</li>
<li><b><a href="/Sorcerer" title="Sorcerer">Sorcerer</a>:</b> (Mage) Magic-focused class specializing in dealing significant magic-based damage.</li>
<li><b><a href="/Elementalist" title="Elementalist">Elementalist</a>:</b> (Mage) Summoner of spirits capable of aiding in battle.</li></ul>
<h3 class="bonfire" id="Aion_2_Release_and_Availability">
Aion 2 Release and Availability</h3>Aion 2 will be released in Korea and Taiwan in late 2025. A wide global release is currently slated for mid-2026.
