<h3 class="bonfire" id="Aion_2_System_Requirements">
Aion 2 System Requirements</h3><h5 id="MINIMUM_REQUIREMENTS">
MINIMUM REQUIREMENTS</h5>
<ul><li>OS: 64 Bit Windows 10/11</li>
<li>Memory: 16 GB</li>
<li>Graphics Card: FHD / GTX 1660 (6GB)</li>
<li>CPU: Intel Core i5-10400F / AMD Ryzen 3 3300X</li></ul>
<h5 id="RECOMMENDED_REQUIREMENTS">
RECOMMENDED REQUIREMENTS</h5>
<ul><li>OS: 64 Bit Windows 10/11</li>
<li>Memory: 32 GB</li>
<li>Graphics Card: NVIDIA RTX 3060 Ti / QHD</li>
<li>CPU: Intel Core i5-12400F / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X</li></ul>
</div></div>
<h2 class="titlearea" id="Classes_in_Aion_2">
Classes in Aion 2</h2><div class="col-sm-6"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-sm-6">&#160;</div></div></div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center;"><h3 class="special" id="Gladiator">
Gladiator</h3>
		<div class="row">
		<div class="col-xs-6">
<div class="row g-0"><div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Gladiator" title="Gladiator"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/b/b2/Gladiator-icon-aion2-wiki-guide.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Gladiator" title="Gladiator"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/1/1a/Gladiator-class-aion-2-wiki-guide_%281%29.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div>A melee powerhouse with impactful wide-area attacks. Attacks are slow, but damaging. This class excels at frontline combat, dealing high damage.</div>
<div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center;"><h3 class="special" id="Templar">
Templar</h3>
		<div class="row">
		<div class="col-xs-6">
<div class="row g-0"><div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Templar" title="Templar"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/d/da/Templar-icon-aion2-wiki-guide.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Templar" title="Templar"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/c/cd/Templar-class-aion-2-wiki-guide_%281%29.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div>The templar wields a shield and is capable of absorbing significant damage with defensive maneuvers. They are ideal for holding the enemy's attention.</div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="row"><div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center;"><h3 class="special" id="Assassin">
Assassin</h3><div class="row"><div class="col-xs-6"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Assassin" title="Assassin"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/7/7e/Assassin-icon-aion2-wiki-guide.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Assassin" title="Assassin"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/7/79/Assassin-class-aion-2-wiki-guide_%281%29.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div>The assassin is agile and deals high-burst damage. This class is ideal for those looking to play the field with hit-and-run strikes.</div>
<div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center;"><h3 class="special" id="Ranger">
Ranger</h3><div class="row"><div class="col-xs-6"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Ranger" title="Ranger"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/c/c5/Ranger-icon-aion2-wiki-guide.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Ranger" title="Ranger"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/4/49/Ranger-class-aion-2-wiki-guide_%281%29.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div>
<p>Skilled in long-range combat, the ranger is best utilized by those aiming for precision and impact.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center;"><h3 class="special" id="Sorcerer">
Sorcerer</h3><div class="row"><div class="col-xs-6"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Sorcerer" title="Sorcerer"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/e/ef/Sorcerer-icon-aion2-wiki-guide.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Sorcerer" title="Sorcerer"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/d/dd/Spiritmaster-class-aion-2-wiki-guide_%281%29.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div>
<p>This magic-wielder delivers devastating damage utilizing elemental magic.</p></div>
<div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center;"><h3 class="special" id="Elementalist">
Elementalist</h3><div class="row"><div class="col-xs-6"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Elementalist" title="Elementalist"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/b/b2/Elementalist-icon-aion2-wiki-guide.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Elementalist" title="Elementalist"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/6/6f/Sorcerer-class-aion-2-wiki-guide_%281%29.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div>
<p>This class summons elemental spirits to accompany them into battle.</p></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center;"><h3 class="special" id="Cleric">
Cleric</h3><div class="row"><div class="col-xs-6"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Cleric" title="Cleric"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/4/4e/Cleric-icon-aion2-wiki-guide.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Cleric" title="Cleric"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/e/e7/Cleric-class-aion-2-wiki-guide_%281%29.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div>
<p>Clerics act as healers and will provide supporting buffs to allies.</p></div>
<div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center;"><h3 class="special" id="Chanter">
Chanter</h3><div class="row"><div class="col-xs-6"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Chanter" title="Chanter"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/a/ac/Chanter-icon-aion2-wiki-guide.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="col-sm-6"><figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/Chanter" title="Chanter"><img src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/1/17/Chanter-class-aion-2-wiki-guide_%281%29.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div>
<p>This class offers buffs for allies both offensively and defensively in the midst of battle.</p></div></div>
<h2 class="titlearea" id="Aion_2_News">
Aion 2 News</h2>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-sm-6"><h3 class="bonfire" id="Taiwan_and_Korea_AION_2_Launch,_November_19,_2025">
Taiwan and Korea AION 2 Launch, November 19, 2025</h3>AION 2 is now available for the Taiwan and Korea clients and regions. We're hard at work gathering information to update this wiki, so stay tuned!
<h3 class="bonfire" id="Reservation_Period_Ended,_October_17,_2025">
Reservation Period Ended, October 17, 2025</h3>The Name Reservation period has ended early due to the 22 servers reaching capacity. Further updates will be added as they become available.
<h3 class="bonfire" id="October_Class_Skill_Showcase">
October Class Skill Showcase</h3>Following the livestream on October 1st, NCsoft Korea and Taiwan began releasing short videos detailing the skills and abilities for each of Aion 2's main classes over the course of several days. Videos of each class have been uploaded to the Shorts section of the Official Aion 2 YouTube Channel.
<p>The Skillset showcases are still in-development footage and may change before the official release, below are the currently released showcases.
</p>
<ul><li><b>October 3rd:</b> Cleric Skillset Showcase</li>
<li><b>October 4th</b>: Templar Skillset Showcase + Sorcerer Skillset Showcase</li>
<li><b>October 5th</b>: Gladiator Skillset Showcase + Elementalist Skillset Showcase</li>
<li><b>October 7th</b>: Assassin Skillset Showcase</li>
<li><b>October 8th</b>: Ranger Skillset Showcase</li></ul>
<h3 class="bonfire" id="Korean_Registration_Announcement">
Korean Registration Announcement</h3>On October 2nd, NCsoft Korea and Taiwan revealed their plans for Server and Character Name reservations for players registering in Korea. The post included a short guide on when the reservation period will be available, how Korean players can access it, and what aspects of character creation can be pre-selected. We will summarize the information shared below:
<h4 id="Registration_Period">
Registration Period</h4>
<ul><li>Players will be able to register for Aion 2 from <b>Thursday, October 16th 2025, at 14:00 KST</b> <b>until Monday, January 20th 2026. </b>Registration will be available until servers are full.</li>
<li>To preregister, players simply need to access the official Aion 2 Website . No game download will be necessary.</li></ul>
<h4 id="How_to_Register">
How to Register</h4>
<ol><li>Log in with your PLAYNC Account</li>
<li>Choose your Faction</li>
<li>Select one of the available servers</li>
<li>Reserve your Character Name</li></ol>
<h4 id="Important_Notes_for_Registration">
Important Notes for Registration</h4>
<ul><li><b>Servers are divided by faction. </b>In normal moment-to-moment gameplay, you will not encounter players in other factions outside of PvP battles in the Abyss, which employ 1:1 Server Matching.</li>
<li>Once your server and Character Name have been selected in registration, you cannot change either of them at a later date. As such, please choose wisely.</li></ul>
<h3 class="bonfire" id="October_Livestream">
October Livestream</h3>On October 1st, NCsoft Korea and Taiwan held a special livestream. They showcased PvE instances from a Chanter’s POV and demonstrated minigames. For the first time, viewers got a closer look at Chanter skills and their effects. Additional information shared was as follows:
<h4 id="Character_Creation">
Character Creation</h4>Players can share character models online.
<ul><li>It will be free to download others’ designs.</li>
<li>If a player's model gets downloaded, they will earn premium currency (10%).</li></ul>
<h4 id="PvP">
PvP</h4>PvP gear can only be bought with <b>Abyss Points (AP) </b>
<ul><li>Players can buy consumables with AP that are also craftable.</li>
<li>Abyss Points sources include:
<ul><li>PvP (1v1, 4v4, 8v8).</li>
<li>PvE enemies in the Abyss.</li>
<li>Minigames vs other players.</li>
<li>Supply quests which run daily/weekly. Players can turn in items for AP. These will be open to all servers.</li>
<li>There will be no time-gating for AP farming.</li></ul></li>
<li>Extracting AP gear refunds 80% of the AP cost.</li>
<li>PvP progression includes ranks and transforms (not as overpowered as Aion 1).</li>
<li>Minigames reminds Fall Guys or memory/reaction challenges vs other players.</li></ul>
<h4 id="PvE">
PvE</h4>Dungeon loot can be traded within the player group involved with the Dungeon.
<ul><li>Dungeon gear is Bound on Pickup, however, some pieces will be tradable among group members.</li>
<li>PvE gear is separate: Abyss gear will not be required if you only engage with PvE.</li></ul>
<h4 id="Crafting">
Crafting</h4>Crafting will be a major system in Aion 2.
<ul><li>This will provide players with best-in-slot PvE items.</li>
<li>All crafted items are tradable.</li></ul>
</div>
<div class="col-sm-6"><h4 id="Enchanting_Equipment">
Enchanting Equipment</h4>Enchanting has a 100% success rate up to +10 item level.
<ul><li>After +10 failure is possible, but:
<ul><li>Items do not break or reduce in level.</li>
<li>Each failure raises the next success chance.</li></ul></li>
<li>- Extracting gear refunds 100% of enhancement stones used in it.</li></ul>
<h4 id="Miscellaneous_Info">
Miscellaneous Info</h4><figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/File:Aionspecs-home-aion2-wiki-guide.webp" class="mw-file-description" title="aionspecs home aion2 wiki guide"><img alt="aionspecs home aion2 wiki guide" src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/4/4e/Aionspecs-home-aion2-wiki-guide.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="600" height="388" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption>aionspecs home aion2 wiki guide</figcaption></figure>
<ul><li>System Requirements have been revealed.</li>
<li>Most items are Bind on Equip.</li>
<li>Mounts can also act as pets.</li>
<li>Console releases have been confirmed for the future.</li>
<li>More mount choices are being added to the pre-registration rewards.</li>
<li>Monthly Subscription is reported to be approximately €13 / $14, and a Premium Subscription will be approximately $20.
<ul><li>A Subscription is not required to play in general, but is expected to provide additional benefits</li></ul></li></ul>
<h3 class="bonfire" id="September_Livestream">
September Livestream</h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Aion 2 Developers provided an in depth update on various factors of Aion 2 during their recent livestream. They covered a great deal of topics, which we’ll summarise below. </span>
</p>
<h3 id="Gameplay">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Gameplay</span></h3><h4 id="Dungeons_&amp;_PVP">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Dungeons &amp; PVP</span></h4>
<ul><li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Dungeons can be instantly jumped into via teleportation. This is to ensure that people can level up without being attacked in front of dungeon entrances.This ensures leveling isn’t interrupted.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">PVP encounters while leveling are being replaced with dedicated PVP content.</span></li></ul>
<h4 id="Combat_on_Mobile">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Combat on Mobile</span></h4>
<ul><li><span style="font-weight: 400;">There is no full auto combat. However, there are combat assistance features that aim to help mobile players during fights.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Combat assistance makes the game more accessible and increases enjoyability for mobile players. Players still have to interact and actually play the game.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Without this feature, mobile would likely be considered too hard to play.</span></li></ul>
<h4 id="Abyss_Zone_PVP">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Abyss Zone PVP</span></h4>
<ul><li><span style="font-weight: 400;">PvP zone is accessible for 7 hours per week, this timer can be extended with items.</span></li></ul>
<h4 id="Death_&amp;_Revival">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Death &amp; Revival</span></h4>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Depending on the character's death, certain conditions apply to revival. In the case of a PVE death, revival items can be used, whereas with a PVP death, a revival crystal cannot be used if the player is killed by an enemy faction. Kisks can be used to set a respawn point, functioning similarly to Aion 1.</span>
</p>
<h4 id="Factions">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Factions</span></h4>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Elyos and Asmodians are similar now, compared with Aion1. There are still some differences, but these are not exaggerated.</span>
</p>
<h4 id="Mounts_&amp;_Housing">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Mounts &amp; Housing</span></h4>
<ul><li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Mounts can be pets that will carry the player character.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Housing allows the player to display their achievements and reward statues.</span></li></ul>
<h3 id="UI_Feedback">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">UI Feedback</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Players have highlighted concerns that the UI might look mobile focussed. The developers took time to reassure players that the game is PC first, and that the UI is not fully polished due to rushing (to get ready for the open beta). UI changes have been made since the last broadcast to move towards a PC feeling UI. </span>
</p>
<h3 id="release_date_aion_2_wiki_guide">
<figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/File:Release-date-aion-2-wiki-guide.png" class="mw-file-description" title="release date aion 2 wiki guide"><img alt="release date aion 2 wiki guide" src="https://static0.fextralifeimages.com/file/aion2/b/be/Release-date-aion-2-wiki-guide.png" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="600" height="318" class="mw-file-element" /></a><figcaption>release date aion 2 wiki guide</figcaption></figure></h3><h3 id="Currency_System">
Currency System</h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Aion 2 will have two currencies available, Kinah, the in-game currency, and Quna, the shop currency. The Auction house uses Kinah only. In addition, trading will be possible between Kinah and Quna, this will be a player driven exchange, and ratios are determined by the player economy. </span>
</p>
<h3 id="Monetization">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Monetization</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Aion 2 will be Free to play, and will have subscription and battle pass options. In addition: </span>
</p>
<ul><li><span style="font-weight: 400;">The in game cash shop includes cosmetics, outfits, weapon skins, pets, wings.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Pets can be both earned during gameplay or bought in store.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">A wardrobe system will be available for skin usage.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Players can use the Trading post to purchase consumables and limited bags. Enchantment stones will not be available.</span></li></ul>
<h3 id="Release_and_Pre-Launch">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Release and Pre-Launch</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The developers shared the following regarding release:</span>
</p>
<ul><li><span style="font-weight: 400;">The official launch date has been confirmed as November 19th, 2025 (or 18th depending on your timezone).</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Pre-Download &amp; Pre-Character Creation opens November 16–18, 2025.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Pre-registration rewards include Kinah and a mount (no phone required).</span></li></ul>
</div></div>
<div class="row"><h2 class="titlearea" id="Everything_We_Know_About_Aion_2">
Everything We Know About Aion 2</h2><ul class="gallery mw-gallery-traditional" data-align="center">
